 "_": "GENERATED-ADJACENT: the one place the item tile colours live. tools/gen_item_tiles.mjs draws the text tiles from it and tools/gamedata/export_item_tiles.py draws the game-art ones, so both agree. family: shipment/item category -> palette family. palette: family -> [tile colour, text colour]. rim: item classification -> border colour. tame_tier: a tame's tile colour, indexed by its Tame-sheet Tier modulo 6 -- the sheet runs to tier 10 and there are six colours, so tier 0 and 6 share, 1 and 7, and so on. tame_boss is the colour for a monster with no tame row, and rim.boss the gold edge those carry. All are pre-lift, like palette.",
